[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Copy %%ETCDIR%%/tuwunel.toml.sample to %%ETCDIR%%/tuwunel.toml and set at
least server_name before starting the service.  The database is kept in
/var/db/tuwunel.

Tuwunel speaks plain HTTP and expects a reverse proxy in front of it for
TLS and for serving the .well-known delegation of your domain.
EOM
}
]
